                  <provenance type="#c"><orgName role="fmo" key="mlgbOrg_283">Kinloss, Moray.
                        Cistercian abbey of Saint Mary the Virgin</orgName><p>"Dominus Johannes
                        Smyth monachus á Kynloss qui hunc librum scripsit ... anno domini 1557 et
                        [?] 17 decembris etatis vero sue 65 atque sepultus prope utrumque parentem
                        ante ostium sacelle sanctorum laurentii et bernardi ubi ipse vivens
                        sacrificare solebat" (fol. 60v).</p><p>Fols. 44r--60v contain a chronicle
                        mainly of Scottish affairs with special reference in the latter part to
                        Kinloss. The obits of John Smith (1542) and Joneta Dawry his wife (1544) are
                        entered.</p></provenance>
